  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUpcoming Elections - Government - Muscatine County, Iowa\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n Search\n \n \n \n\n Menu\n \n \n\n \n\n About \n \n\n Boards & Commissions\n Cemeteries\n Communities\n Elected Officials\n Historic Preservation\n School Districts\n Township Information\n \n \n \n\n Departments \n \n\n Administration Office\n Assessor\n Attorney\n Auditor\n Board of Health\n Board of Supervisors\n Community Services\n Conservation\n County Development\n Emergency Management/911\n Engineer's Office & Highway Department\n General Assistance\n Medical Examiner\n Recorder\n Sheriff\n Treasurer\n Veterans Affairs\n \n \n \n\n Resources \n \n\n Bid Notices\n Calendar\n Careers\n Courts\n Frequently Asked Questions\n News\n Notifications\n \n \n \n\n Contact\n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n Search Muscatine County, Iowa\n \n \n \n \n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \nAuditor Elections & Voting\n \n\nUpcoming Elections\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nView the dates listed below for upcoming elections in Muscatine County. \n\n \n\n2026 Elections \n\n 2026 General Election\n \n\n November 3, 2026\n\n General Election \n \n\n A General Election is the election in which federal and state officers, members of Congress and of the general assembly, county and township officers, and other officers appear on the ballot. General Elections are held the 1st Tuesday after the 1st Monday in November of each even-numbered year. \n \n \n\n Sample Ballot(s)\n Public Notice \n \n \n \n \n\n Elections & Voting\n Am I Registered?\n Register to Vote\n How to Vote\n Voting Precincts\n Absentee Voting\n Military/Overseas Voting\n Voter ID\n Upcoming Elections\n Election Results\n Election Types\n Precinct Election Officials\n Candidate Information\n Elected Officials\n Election Maps\n Auditor\n FAQ\n Department Home\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n Administration Building\n 414 E. Third St.\n \nMuscatine, IA 52761 \n \n\n Office Hours\n Monday - Friday \n8:00 a.m. - 4:30 p.m. \nClosed Holidays\n\n Department Hours May Vary\n \n \n\n Contact Us\n Closed Holidays \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n© 2026 Muscatine County | Accessibility | \nTranslate LanguageTranslate Website\n \npowered by \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \nUpcoming Holiday Closure Schedule\n \n \nVeterans' Day (November 11, 2026)\n \nThanksgiving (November 26, 2026)\n \nDay after Thanksgiving (November 27, 2026)\n \nChristmas Eve (December 24, 2026)\n \nChristmas (December 25, 2026)\n \nNew Years Day (January 1, 2027)\n \nMemorial Day (May 31, 2027)\n \nIndependence Day (July 5, 2027)\n \nLabor Day (September 6, 2027)\n \nVeteran's Day (November 11, 2027)\n \n\n\n\n"
